ft(- \\frac{x^{2} y}{y^{2} + 1} - y + 1\\right)\\,\\mathbf j$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718576} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3124e584-78dc-5be9-9215-a55c0b2b3566" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718538} {:answer/id #uuid "e8387955-389f-5e20-a95a-32e636b52d71" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718584}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e8387955-389f-5e20-a95a-32e636b52d71" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718584} :answer-field/id #uuid "e1bf6af5-3aa0-55a4-b1ce-4cb939fe59ff" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbf F=$ $\\left(x \\ln{\\left(y^{2} + 1 \\right)} - 2 x - 1\\right)\\,\\mathbf i$ $+\\left(\\frac{x^{2} y}{y^{2} + 1} - 2 y + 1\\right)\\,\\mathbf j$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718581}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "000e1637-4d68-5364-acbf-3e1f271705ad" :question/problem "Which of the following vector fields are conservative on $\\mathbb R^2$? Select all that apply." :question/worked-solution "All components have continuous first partial derivatives on $\\mathbb R^2$. Polynomial, exponential, trigonometric and arctangent functions are smooth here; any logarithm has positive argument and any denominator is strictly positive. Thus $\\mathbf V=P\\,\\mathbf i+Q\\,\\mathbf j$ is **conservative** exactly when $P_y=Q_x$ everywhere.\n\nFor $\\mathbf F$, differentiate each component with respect to the indicated variable:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P&=x \\ln{\\left(y^{2} + 1 \\right)} - 2 x - 1,\\\\Q&=\\frac{x^{2} y}{y^{2} + 1} - 2 y + 1,\\\\P_y&=\\frac{2 x y}{y^{2} + 1},\\\\Q_x&=\\frac{2 x y}{y^{2} + 1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$P_y=Q_x$ is an identity, so $\\mathbf F$ is conservative.\n\nFor $\\mathbf G$, differentiate each component with respect to the indicated variable:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P&=2 e^{2 x - 2 y} + 1,\\\\Q&=- 2 e^{2 x - 2 y},\\\\P_y&=- 4 e^{2 x - 2 y},\\\\Q_x&=- 4 e^{2 x - 2 y}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$P_y=Q_x$ is an identity, so $\\mathbf G$ is conservative.\n\nFor $\\mathbf H$, differentiate each component with respect to the indicated variable:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P&=- x \\ln{\\left(y^{2} + 1 \\right)} - x - 1,\\\\Q&=- \\frac{x^{2} y}{y^{2} + 1} - y + 1,\\\\P_y&=- \\frac{2 x y}{y^{2} + 1},\\\\Q_x&=- \\frac{2 x y}{y^{2} + 1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$P_y=Q_x$ is an identity, so $\\mathbf H$ is conservative.\n\nSelect $\\mathbf F$, $\\mathbf G$, $\\mathbf H$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186718531 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "02ff8b9f-83da-5c31-817d-6afa31f5e263" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718524} {:answer/id #uuid "777c83a1-8872-50dd-a2c7-1954825f77fa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718557}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "777c83a1-8872-50dd-a2c7-1954825f77fa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718557} :answer-field/id #uuid "0d049dc9-fab5-574b-bfe7-f75d5a49f9a2" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbf H=$ $\\left(2 e^{x - 2 y} - 1\\right)\\,\\mathbf i$ $+\\left(1 - 4 e^{x - 2 y}\\right)\\,\\mathbf j$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718528} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "56d15177-105a-51ba-8edd-a67373c11448" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb