swer/id #uuid "db144147-0b93-50af-bf11-4a86b7066678" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718579} :answer-field/id #uuid "e2ee3a69-3055-5dcf-8d1e-b6d647feb5b5" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718582} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "df74ba61-fdb8-53b7-9f34-ed242eba1d09" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718580} {:answer/id #uuid "e6b8840d-6413-55ad-8857-a96931f36bc6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718583}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e6b8840d-6413-55ad-8857-a96931f36bc6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718583} :answer-field/id #uuid "fbdf5e0d-a149-5208-84e8-6c8e7757ca2d" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbf H=$ $\\left(- x + \\arctan{\\left(y \\right)} + 1\\right)\\,\\mathbf i$ $+\\left(\\frac{x}{y^{2} + 1} - y + 1\\right)\\,\\mathbf j$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718587}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "402ecf05-6a80-5456-acfc-72e162652330" :question/problem "Which of the following vector fields are conservative on $\\mathbb R^2$? Select all that apply." :question/worked-solution "All components have continuous first partial derivatives on $\\mathbb R^2$. Polynomial, exponential, trigonometric and arctangent functions are smooth here; any logarithm has positive argument and any denominator is strictly positive. Thus $\\mathbf V=P\\,\\mathbf i+Q\\,\\mathbf j$ is **conservative** exactly when $P_y=Q_x$ everywhere.\n\nFor $\\mathbf F$, differentiate each component with respect to the indicated variable:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P&=- x - 2 \\arctan{\\left(y \\right)} - 1,\\\\Q&=- y,\\\\P_y&=- \\frac{2}{y^{2} + 1},\\\\Q_x&=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe derivatives are not equal everywhere, so $\\mathbf F$ is not conservative. At $(0,0)$, the difference is $-2\\ne0$.\n\nFor $\\mathbf G$, differentiate each component with respect to the indicated variable:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P&=\\cos{\\left(x - y \\right)} - 1,\\\\Q&=1 - \\cos{\\left(x - y \\right)},\\\\P_y&=\\sin{\\left(x - y \\right)},\\\\Q_x&=\\sin{\\left(x - y \\right)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$P_y=Q_x$ is an identity, so $\\mathbf G$ is conservative.\n\nFor $\\mathbf H$, differentiate each component with respect to the indicated variable:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P&=- x + \\arctan{\\left(y \\right)} + 1,\\\\Q&=\\frac{x}{y^{2} + 1} - y + 1,\\\\P_y&=\\frac{1}{y^{2} + 1},\\\\Q_x&=\\frac{1}{y^{2} + 1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$P_y=Q_x$ is an identity, so $\\mathbf H$ is conservative.\n\nSelect $\\mathbf G$, $\\mathbf H$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186718550 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "33b3fbd0-c107-5d3e-a4c0-d97bb415a11f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718539} {:answer/id #uuid "72afc608-6157-560b-bf74-e8fef2f11562" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718555}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "72afc608-6157-560b-bf74-e8fef2f11562" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718555} :answer-field/id #uuid "03e487cc-1bee-5159-b91e-20eed95da509" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbf G=$ $\\left(- 2 x y^{3} + 2 x - 1\\right)\\,\\mathbf i$ $+\\left(- 9 x^{2} y^{2} + 2 y\\right)\\,\\mathbf j$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718525} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "75a53fdf-bb02-52ff-b999-fa07ce9b0370" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718556} {:answer/id #uuid "9ffb72ff-5ca3-5249-9694-b881278866db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718568}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "75a53fdf-bb02-52ff-b999-fa07ce9b0370" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718556} :answer-field/id #uuid "55ef0429-345d-5f0d-b8ed-728645bb1819" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbf H=$ $\\left(- 2 y e^{2 x} + 1\\right)\\,\\mathbf i$ $+\\left(y + e^{2 x}\\right)\\,\\mathbf j$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718546} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6c7d26d0-1779-5552-970e-77724bfcf7fb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718552} {:answer/id #uuid "8f1f541e-d390-5e07-b8ae-7b7cdb88be97" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718563}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8f1f541e-d390-5e07-b8ae-7b7cdb88be97" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718563} :answer-field/id #uuid "979f8d27-93c3-5d6b-80db-6224e742689a" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbf F=$ $\\left(- 4 x y - 2 x\\right)\\,\\mathbf i$ $+\\left(- 2 x^{2} - 2 y\\right)\\,\\mathbf j$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718565} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e682db1-78b9-572e-bf91-dbadd53986fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.ty